# probe (quest rework P8): bfwin, a GM's battlefield:setStatus(xi.battlefield.status.WON) on the char's battlefield,
# then the two ticks a kill takes. Waking the Beast (otherAreas 32, still Lua): the Full Moon Fountain's fight (random
# avatar order, HP-threshold phases, an unkillable Carbuncle until phase 6) cannot be driven by kill steps. Accepted (a
# GM) with the six eyes and the resonator: MS_Entrance's 32000, area 1 (226), entered; bfwin: won, 32001 opens;
# finished on 0: battlefieldWin 226: the seven key items taken, the Faded Ruby, Option 1.
lists FullMoonFountain/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=FullMoonFountain pos=-301.8,9.5,-260.1 job=SMN lvl=75
quest OtherAreas.WakingTheBeast accepted
keyitem EyeOfFlames
keyitem EyeOfFrost
keyitem EyeOfGales
keyitem EyeOfStorms
keyitem EyeOfTides
keyitem EyeOfTremors
keyitem RainbowResonator
login
trigger MS_Entrance                     # the 32000 menu
update 32000 option=33                  # area 1 (226)
finish                                  # entered
bfwin                                   # a GM: WON; 32001
finish option=0                         # battlefieldWin 226: the seven taken; the Faded Ruby; Option 1
